{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"598e270af360ac4f3ff8134232de4295e1cfeb80712ea3084d209f517a58f186","ja":"取材で食べたお団子、美味しかったわね♪\n明日の打ち上げに、差し入れしようかしら。","zh":"采访时吃的团子，真美味呢♪\n明天的庆功会上，要不要带去当慰劳品呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b060e57a05218987df2d1c2cb67b913c2fb76e6aac2ba08ce1180f7031a52196","ja":"はい、みなさんの好きな味を聞いてみましょう♪\n……あれ？　向こうから来るのは……。","zh":"好，来问问大家喜欢的口味吧♪\n……咦？从那边走过来的是……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1f85f2dc0dd313f3f04065058c76a857318d0f7f49f8ee0ac89136e575260dc8","ja":"わあ～っ！？","zh":"哇啊～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e0eab0b577c0e841e6a99556c6cf245835765bc3078d7d4c370bde2ff62c9ae9","ja":"……な、なんや、伊織と星梨花やないか。\nふ、ふたりとも奇遇やな～！","zh":"……什、什么嘛，这不是伊织和星梨花吗。\n真、真巧啊，你们两个～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"3af32216bd64fc0b8d09f32e5384d295193cb95e7470b41c82503458b96abbbb","ja":"なんでそんなにオドオドしてるのよ。\nあやしいわね～。","zh":"干嘛这么战战兢兢的啊。\n真可疑呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7a935441c24ded32a5ca08e6ed0729105975d1ab19bc1d65fd7d7ae6e31cfc1a","ja":"べ、別に！？　なんもないで！？\nえ～っと……ふたりは今からどこ行くん？","zh":"没、没什么啊！？什么事都没有哦！？\n那个……你们两个现在要去哪里啊？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"276bec1e9f1e9cfb28b61571b22b5e68b0c3bf7e52da6c4cdf4855b2e22f9685","ja":"劇場に戻るところなんです。\n雑誌撮影のお仕事が終わったので。","zh":"我正要回剧场呢。\n因为杂志拍摄的工作已经结束了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"57e5fb7714231632d196c0d84c084305149e80a972fe072385aa1b785f70db37","ja":"あ、あ～……なるほどな。\nじゃ、じゃあ私は買い物があるからここらへんで……。","zh":"啊、啊～……原来如此啊。\n那、那我还要去买东西，就先在这边……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"6c1d82e153107897f796d451e62b0fc865e6cf946ed51b4303fcb3f79e79cffe","ja":"ちょっと待ちなさい！　こそこそ何企んでるのよ？\n伊織ちゃんの目はごまかせないわよ！","zh":"给我等一下！偷偷摸摸在盘算些什么呢？\n可瞒不过小伊织我的法眼哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"9d7165847d494b642b6360a05a7c6056a7b765661fbeef0e401f1c28894336df","ja":"いやいや、ホンマ大したことないって！\nちょっと、明日の打ち上げでサプライズを……あっ！","zh":"不不，真没什么大不了的啦！\n只是想在明天的庆功宴上准备个惊喜……啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1110.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ed583e1f5247ab5864d89066b82707f5583a6d297f027e1b7c48decdb30d2352","ja":"サプライズ……！？\n奈緒さん、詳しく聞かせてもらえませんか？","zh":"惊喜……！？\n奈绪，能详细跟我说说吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
